\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The two conditions on the benchmark, 100k environment steps each, one seed each, all from the same starting checkpoint. \emph  {Lives}: training lives after excluding the three per run that were open during a demonstrator injection (\cref  {app:inject}). \emph  {Teacher finishes}: lives in which the demonstrator, given control after the actor crafted a stone pickaxe, went on to craft the iron pickaxe, out of all such handoffs. \emph  {Actor, unaided}: lives with no handoff in which the actor crafted the iron pickaxe. \emph  {Held-out}: iron pickaxes in ten actor-only lives at 0, 25k, 50k, 75k, and 100k steps.\relax }}{9}{table.caption.24}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:switches}{{2}{9}{The two conditions on the benchmark, 100k environment steps each, one seed each, all from the same starting checkpoint. \emph {Lives}: training lives after excluding the three per run that were open during a demonstrator injection (\cref {app:inject}). \emph {Teacher finishes}: lives in which the demonstrator, given control after the actor crafted a stone pickaxe, went on to craft the iron pickaxe, out of all such handoffs. \emph {Actor, unaided}: lives with no handoff in which the actor crafted the iron pickaxe. \emph {Held-out}: iron pickaxes in ten actor-only lives at 0, 25k, 50k, 75k, and 100k steps.\relax }{table.caption.24}{}}
\newlabel{tab:switches@cref}{{[table][2][]2}{[1][9][]9}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Benchmark runs, one seed each. (a)\nobreakspace  {}Fraction of handoffs on which the demonstrator went on to craft the iron pickaxe, with 95\% Wilson intervals. Walking back to the station roughly halved it. (b)\nobreakspace  {}Held-out lives played by the actor alone: it reaches the stone pickaxe, the precondition for the rare craft, in two to six of ten lives at 100k steps, and never crafts the iron pickaxe (crosses). (c)\nobreakspace  {}Cumulative training lives with a stone pickaxe (solid) and with an actor-only iron pickaxe (dotted, zero throughout). Gray lines mark the demonstrator injections every 25k steps.\relax }}{9}{figure.caption.25}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:benchmark}{{4}{9}{Benchmark runs, one seed each. (a)~Fraction of handoffs on which the demonstrator went on to craft the iron pickaxe, with 95\% Wilson intervals. Walking back to the station roughly halved it. (b)~Held-out lives played by the actor alone: it reaches the stone pickaxe, the precondition for the rare craft, in two to six of ten lives at 100k steps, and never crafts the iron pickaxe (crosses). (c)~Cumulative training lives with a stone pickaxe (solid) and with an actor-only iron pickaxe (dotted, zero throughout). Gray lines mark the demonstrator injections every 25k steps.\relax }{figure.caption.25}{}}
\newlabel{fig:benchmark@cref}{{[figure][4][]4}{[1][9][]9}}
